qlitehtml: skip the full re-layout when only the viewport height changes.

Adds layoutCount()/documentHeight()/setZoomFactorWithoutRender() and splits
resizeEvent: when the layout width is unchanged and the document does not
depend on the viewport height (percentage heights, percentage top/bottom,
CSS variables, fixed positioning), only scroll bar ranges are refreshed.
setHtml() rescans the document every time, so the guard cannot go stale.

